    <!-- ════════════════════ PAGE 3 ════════════════════ -->
    <div class="at-page">

      <div class="at-section">
        <h2 class="at-h2">The fifteen habits of <em>AI Thinking</em>.</h2>
        <p class="at-section-intro">
          The durable principles. True of AI in 2020, true today, true of whichever model ships in 2030. Internalise these and you can direct any AI well.
        </p>
        <ol class="at-habits">
          <li class="at-habit axis-frame">
            <p class="at-habit-num">01 &middot; Frame</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Learn for the AI of tomorrow.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Build around approach, not tools.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-frame">
            <p class="at-habit-num">02 &middot; Frame</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">It is a communication problem.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Not a technical one.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-frame">
            <p class="at-habit-num">03 &middot; Frame</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Three moves, on repeat.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Choose, communicate, evaluate.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-choose">
            <p class="at-habit-num">04 &middot; Choose</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Pick the right AI for the task.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">When in doubt, ask AI which AI to use.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-comm">
            <p class="at-habit-num">05 &middot; Communicate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Don't perfect the prompt. Frame the conversation.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">The session is the unit, not the message.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-comm">
            <p class="at-habit-num">06 &middot; Communicate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Great examples beat great instructions.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Show what good looks like. Show what bad looks like.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-comm">
            <p class="at-habit-num">07 &middot; Communicate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Ask AI to ask you questions.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Socratic beats one-shot. Every single time.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-eval">
            <p class="at-habit-num">08 &middot; Recursion</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Ask AI for help with AI.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Use the machines on each other.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-eval">
            <p class="at-habit-num">09 &middot; Evaluate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Iteration is everything.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Three to five passes. Every time.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-eval">
            <p class="at-habit-num">10 &middot; Evaluate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Don't take the quick win.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Push back. Ask what it is holding back.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-eval">
            <p class="at-habit-num">11 &middot; Evaluate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Never trust one machine.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Same task, three models, compare.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-eval">
            <p class="at-habit-num">12 &middot; Evaluate</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Always humanise the output.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Nothing ships raw. Layer your own twenty per cent.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-edge">
            <p class="at-habit-num">13 &middot; Edge</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Conviction. Art. Sense. Judgment.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">These come from you, not the machine.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-edge">
            <p class="at-habit-num">14 &middot; Long game</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Your sessions become your playbook.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">The conversations are the corpus. Guard them.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="at-habit axis-edge">
            <p class="at-habit-num">15 &middot; Mental model</p>
            <p class="at-habit-title">Every AI task is one of three things.</p>
            <p class="at-habit-sub">Know (information), Do (action), Show (artefact).</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

